    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/plugins/PluginSlider/assets/splide.min.css"><script src="/plugins/PluginSlider/assets/splide.min.js"></script><div class="splide splide-plugin" id="slider-promo-beranda" style="width:100%;"><div class="splide__track"><ul class="splide__list"><li class="splide__slide"><div class="hero-slide-content" style="width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding-bottom:5rem; color:#fff; background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)), url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542816417-0983c9c9ad53?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=2070) center/cover no-repeat;"><div style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 5%; width:100%; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:2rem;"><div style="max-width:600px;"><h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem; font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; text-shadow:2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Generasi Islam Berkarakter dan Berdaya Saing</h2><p style="margin-bottom:2rem; font-size:1.1rem; opacity:0.9;">Melalui pendidikan berasrama yang modern, Darussalam Bogor membina santri dengan keseimbangan antara ilmu pengetahuan, pembentukan karakter, dan pemahaman nilai-nilai Islam, sehingga lahir generasi yang berilmu dan berakhlak.</p></div><a href="#tentang" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; font-weight:600; font-size:1.1rem; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; transition:color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--gold, #d4af37)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#fff'"><span>Learn more &gt;</span><svg width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></li><li class="splide__slide"><div class="hero-slide-content" style="width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding-bottom:5rem; color:#fff; background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)), url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577896851231-70ef18881754?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=2070) center/cover no-repeat;"><div style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 5%; width:100%; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:2rem;"><div style="max-width:600px;"><h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem; font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight:700; line-height:1.2; text-shadow:2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">Pendaftaran Santri Baru Telah Dibuka</h2><p style="margin-bottom:2rem; font-size:1.1rem; opacity:0.9;">Mari bergabung bersama ribuan santri lainnya untuk merajut masa depan gemilang bersama Pondok Pesantren Darussalam Bogor.</p></div><a href="/pendaftaran" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; font-weight:600; font-size:1.1rem; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; transition:color 0.3s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--gold, #d4af37)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#fff'"><span>Daftar Sekarang</span><svg width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></li></ul></div></div><script>
